{"v":1,"id":"bd847855cb8d","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"When you asked, “What’s the deal?”","s":22.02,"e":27.38},{"t":"you showed Me where you stood.","s":27.43,"e":32.21},{"t":"You kept the rules to keep yourself,","s":32.27,"e":37.92},{"t":"not because you knew My good.","s":38.02,"e":43.4},{"t":"You trimmed your lamp by habit,","s":43.48,"e":48.35},{"t":"not by hunger for My flame -","s":48.43,"e":54.02},{"t":"You spoke My Name with practiced lips,","s":54.07,"e":58.01},{"t":"but never sought Me as i really am..","s":58.09,"e":63.95},{"t":"You thought My patience meant My favor,","s":63.96,"e":69.22},{"t":"thought nearness came from calling “Lord.”","s":69.26,"e":74.65},{"t":"You built a world of borrowed light -","s":74.71,"e":80.51},{"t":"and claimed it as reward.","s":80.56,"e":86.12},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":86.14,"e":88.27},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":88.29,"e":91.58},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":91.64,"e":93.65},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":93.72,"e":96.92},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":96.98,"e":98.98},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":99.02,"e":102.03},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":102.09,"e":104.28},{"t":"yet still, I am not changed.","s":104.34,"e":108.8},{"t":"I hear the whisper rising in you:","s":108.82,"e":114.19},{"t":"“But I meant well… I tried.”","s":111.41,"e":119.38},{"t":"You shaped a god to fit your wants,","s":119.43,"e":125.17},{"t":"and called that hope your guide.","s":125.23,"e":130.55},{"t":"You wanted Me for comfort,","s":130.65,"e":135.46},{"t":"not to walk where I would lead -","s":135.52,"e":141.37},{"t":"Crosses decorate your halls,","s":141.42,"e":145.82},{"t":"Pick up yours and follow me.","s":145.87,"e":150.74},{"t":"And when you fussed, “You left us here!”","s":150.75,"e":153.32},{"t":"you spoke from wounds you chose -","s":153.38,"e":161.77},{"t":"For pride locked your inner door","s":161.81,"e":167.31},{"t":"long before Mine closed.","s":167.41,"e":172.61},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":172.63,"e":174.68},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":174.7,"e":177.91},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":177.97,"e":179.9},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":179.97,"e":183.09},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":183.15,"e":185.07},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":185.11,"e":186.7},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":188.06,"e":190.09},{"t":"yet I am forever the same.","s":190.13,"e":194.97},{"t":"I have not forsaken you,","s":194.99,"e":197.51},{"t":"but you have not yet turned.","s":197.55,"e":200.17},{"t":"You feel abandoned in your dark -","s":200.23,"e":202.7},{"t":"but this is how pride burns.","s":202.74,"e":205.96},{"t":"My child, I was beside you","s":206.06,"e":208.24},{"t":"when your lips cried out My name…","s":208.3,"e":210.76},{"t":"But nearness isn’t claimed by habit -","s":210.8,"e":213.16},{"t":"it’s forged in holy flame.","s":213.18,"e":222.4},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":222.41,"e":224.48},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":224.51,"e":227.79},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":227.87,"e":229.85},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":229.91,"e":233.04},{"t":"You loved an image,","s":233.1,"e":235.03},{"t":"not My living way…","s":235.09,"e":238.22},{"t":"But when you yield -","s":238.28,"e":240.26},{"t":"I will not stay away.","s":240.32,"e":245.04},{"t":"[Outro ]","s":241.62,"e":245.09},{"t":"(soft) When you want me as I am…","s":245.05,"e":250.61},{"t":"I’ll call your name again.","s":250.69,"e":256.38},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":256.39,"e":258.45},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":258.48,"e":261.76},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":261.82,"e":263.76},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":263.82,"e":266.95},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":267.01,"e":268.86},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":268.92,"e":271.97},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":272.03,"e":274.21},{"t":"My child, I can not change.","s":274.26,"e":279.65},{"t":"I can never change!","s":279.73,"e":289.95},{"t":"I can never change!","s":290.03,"e":291.62}],"match":null}
